CHARACTERS = "安安 (An'an): six-year-old Chinese girl, round face, ear-length straight black bob, yellow star hairclip on her left, teal hoodie, blue jeans, white sneakers with red trim. Mom: shoulder-length black hair, coral cardigan, cream trousers. Dad: short black hair, navy sweater, beige trousers. Grandma: short silver bob, lavender cardigan. Friend Lele: six-year-old Chinese boy, short black hair, mustard sweatshirt, navy trousers. Keep each person's identity, hair, clothing and proportions consistent. Include only people specified in this page's scene."
