        (2, "妈妈问：“你觉得什么日子算特别？”安安想了想：“生日，过年，还有很大很大的好事。”", "Mom asked, “What makes a day special?” An'an thought. “Birthdays, New Year, and really big happy things.”", "Bedroom desk conversation: An'an considers question beside closed sticker box, Mom listens, no birthday montage or writing."),
